# Action Feedback — Mandatory

Every user-triggered submit (contact, website requirements, file upload rejection, etc.) **must** show feedback after it finishes — success **or** failure. Silent success/failure is not allowed.

## How (this repo)

Prefer patterns already used on the site:

```ts
import { toast } from "sonner";

// Inline status (ContactForm) — success / error panels are OK
setStatus("success"); // or "error"

// Toast (Website Requirements uploads / validation)
toast.error("File ditolak", { description: "…" });
toast.success("Form terkirim.");
```

Sonner is already wired via `src/components/ui/sonner.tsx` in the root layout.

## Rules

- After every form `fetch` / submit: set a visible status **or** call `toast.success` / `toast.error`
- Keep messages short and specific (match existing Indonesian copy on the page)
- Loading state while the request is in flight (`status === "loading"` / disabled submit)
- Do **not** add a second toast library

## Do not

- Swallow `!res.ok` without UI feedback
- Fire-and-forget `await fetch(...)` with no success/error path
- Rely only on `console.error` for user-facing failures
